{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-7","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：五边形与角","englishTitle":"If three angles of an equilateral pentagon, taken either in order or not in order, be equal, the pentagon will be equiangular.","book":13,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","contentId":"euclid-13-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0e3590e8c6efbeec09974c102080847ce4741c3bb43acfe140e35fcfc7194f7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-7.statement","euclid-13-7.proof.1","euclid-13-7.construction.1","euclid-13-7.proof.2","euclid-13-7.proof.3","euclid-13-7.proof.4","euclid-13-7.proof.5","euclid-13-7.proof.6","euclid-13-7.proof.7","euclid-13-7.proof.8","euclid-13-7.proof.9","euclid-13-7.construction.2","euclid-13-7.proof.10","euclid-13-7.proof.11","euclid-13-7.proof.12","euclid-13-7.proof.13","euclid-13-7.proof.14","euclid-13-7.conclusion","euclid-13-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"666ad9588e8ecf57850a2040886d2f501ee7d28370c10360be1c549b56922657","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If three angles of an equilateral pentagon, taken either in order or not in order, be equal, the pentagon will be equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个等边形的三个角度, 不论是否顺序排列, 均相等, 则五边形为等角形 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a07c323d46664694711f22cd6a448377fe34562649c3452623df6468ec49ba86","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For in the equilateral pentagon ABCDE let, first, three angles taken in order, those at A, B, C, be equal to one another; I say that the pentagon ABCDE is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在等边形ABCDE中,首先,让三个角度排列顺序,即A,B,C,等量方形ABCDE;我说,五边形ABCDE是等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f84cadf77837c3a553f3373701d632858ba1a1d5b2805d08d566a124e6f92a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AC, BE, FD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC,BE,FD连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6142c2973aab1f8e03a87a926959ec4af1beed28b646cdf061bcaa6bdf40d0e2","citations":["euclid-1-4","euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two sides CB, BA are equal to the two sides BA, AE respectively, and the angle CBA is equal to the angle BAE, therefore the base AC is equal to the base BE, the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle ABE, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend, [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] that is, the angle BCA to the angle BEA, and the angle ABE to the angle CAB; hence the side AF is also equal to the side BF. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于双方CB,BA等于双方的方位,BA,BA,BAE角等于方位,因此底边,AC角等于底边,BE角,三角形ABC等于三角形ABE角,其余角度等于其他角度,即等方向BCA角向BEA角向BCA角,角向ABE角向CAB角向BF角向AF角向下,因此,侧面AF也等于侧面BF角。（相关点与线段：CBA） [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59a0c8ca4c5ea1698dbed983e7f7575940b4aa12c295d76e5f4da87a573b1d1e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the whole AC was also proved equal to the whole BE; therefore the remainder FC is also equal to the remainder FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但整个AC也证明等于全部BE;因此其余FC也等于其余FE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5375a573f6bfb76f5a25f47ce5ce3f3450944e267b0db9223eafa7bfdbdb5c14","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD is also equal to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CD也等于DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"03617d4959133ef1dd44a4a061996b753c639b40229de7ed174aa1123bfb6b6a","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the two sides FC, CD are equal to the two sides FE, ED; and the base FD is common to them; therefore the angle FCD is equal to the angle FED. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,双方FC、CD等值FE、ED;底边、FD是双方共有的;因此,FCD角等于FED角。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0d715c801a20a70a019147cbfb1ca5ecec8a3c6b6070b490a0a09ee8117d7b15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BCA was also proved equal to the angle AEB; therefore the whole angle BCD is also equal to the whole angle AED."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BCA角度也证明等于AEB角度;因此,整个BCD角度也等于整个角度AED。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67423c882fcf7af9bdb9250bc924e97386bab07eb58706ecc36c14169c6c6829","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the angle BCD is equal to the angles at A, B; therefore the angle AED is also equal to the angles at A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设说,BCD角等于A,B角;因此,AED角也等于A,B角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46f70aba46641975c3fd797a978a9294a0710fa0278b186b93ba4c6bf1aaa197","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angle CDE is also equal to the angles at A, B, C; therefore the pentagon ABCDE is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,CDE角也等于A、B、C角;因此,五角ABCDE角是等角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90254902ba6d9cff8516408515a21c011a894bc45690da9ab8012a1d9a9f9623","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the given equal angles not be angles taken in order, but let the angles at the points A, C, D be equal; I say that in this case too the pentagon ABCDE is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,让给定的等角不要是按顺序排列的,而让A、C、D点的角相等;我说,在这种情况下,五角ABCDE也是角形的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0874684b50ba803d7117526607f96b80bec328985b03ea7147a9f4be5f405609","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD连接"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec82b69bffeb4227d3f541191bcf315f4dd8f929d8e649d40801024c1dd9e2f2","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the two sides BA, AE are equal to the two sides BC, CD, and they contain equal angles, therefore the base BE is equal to the base BD, the triangle ABE is equal to the triangle BCD, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle AEB is equal to the angle CDB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于双方BA,AE等于双方BC,CD, 并包含相同角度,因此底边,BE等于底边,BD,三角形ABE等于三角形BCD,其余角度将等于其余角度,即平等方所支持的角;因此,AEB的角度等于CDB。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"660d423b46fc89388dbb7eeed68f3bb3a12138dd247dc8250ed66589aff1abfe","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BED is also equal to the angle BDE, since the side BE is also equal to the side BD. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BED角也等于BDE角,因为BE角也等于BD角。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5014272e3cb4da42071e286adc4391acd1d2b7ae0cc286055556b7f37629fe3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole angle AED is equal to the whole angle CDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个角度AED等于整个角度CDE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8c6b2782bb214d1e774480e31f17c50e2f7ccb234e1f5d3145955e961b5fac6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle CDE is, by hypothesis, equal to the angles at A, C; therefore the angle AED is also equal to the angles at A, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CDE角度假设等于A,C角度,因此AED角度也等于A,C角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d50b9e3057d090b4756718b1f3f8303134beca40cd0a1ca4cfd653556ea34116","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle ABC is also equal to the angles at A, C, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,ABC角也等于A、C、D角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7104a2ab4b19ca155e746059a44175ac15f319062bb2065442bcacb718c18b10","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pentagon ABCDE is equiangular. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,五角ABCDE是方形Q. E.D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-7.source","contentId":"euclid-13-7","revisionId":"euclid-13-7@raw-c0e3590e8c6efbee","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ce8a3c5a65fbe34802e07591ee325781a60465781c3b9581d5e72114e9aae63","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-7.proof.2","euclid-13-7.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-7.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-7.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-7.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"I. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.22"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 7"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-4:explicit","id":"euclid-1-4","book":1,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两边及其夹角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-6:explicit","id":"euclid-1-6","book":1,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"等腰三角形逆定理：等角对等边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-8:explicit","id":"euclid-1-8","book":1,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：三边分别相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-7:euclid-1-5:explicit","id":"euclid-1-5","book":1,"number":5,"kind":"proposition","title":"等腰三角形：等边对等角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-7:explicit","id":"euclid-13-17","book":13,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-polygon","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
